        } else {
            // No entries and no keywords? Then print nothing? For query without keywords and without list, it should print highest scored path overall
            // We already filtered, so if entries empty and keywords empty, what to do? Should print nothing? But we saw earlier query --all without keywords printed highest scored.
            // Our entries already includes all if no keywords, sorted, so first is highest.
